  "worked_solution": "To evaluate our multivariable function at the point $(3,{e}^{2}),$ we substitute $x=3$ and $y={e}^{2}$ into the function expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z\\,{|}_{(3,{e}^{2})} & =(x\\operatorname{ln}\u2061y-1){|}_{(3,{e}^{2})} \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{ln}\u2061({e}^{2})-1 \\\\  & =3(2\\operatorname{ln}\u2061e)-1 \\\\  & =3(2)-1 \\\\  & =6-1 \\\\  & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$",
